# API Performance Testing using k6 and Grafana

## Objective
This project is used to perform performance testing for the Purpose of Arrival API and visualize the test results in Grafana.

## Tools
- k6: Used to run the performance test.
- Grafana: Used to view the performance test result in charts and dashboards.

## API
GET /api/v1/dynamic-values-setup/fetch-all?key=PurposeOfArrival

## Test Configuration
- Virtual Users: 2
- Duration: 10 seconds

## Thresholds
- Failed requests should be less than 1%
- 95% of requests should complete within 3 seconds
- More than 95% checks should pass

## Run Command

```bash
k6 cloud run --local-execution k6.cy.js